---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Mico Bot"
	description="What is Mico Bot?"
	pubDate={new Date('May 12 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Mico is a Discord bot built as a sandbox and experimental playground for OORTSKY.
		It serves as a living system where ideas are tested, refined, and validated in real-world usage.
	</p>

	<p>
		Instead of being a fixed product, Mico is treated as an evolving environment.
		Features are added, removed, or reworked based on exploration, experimentation, and system feedback.
		This makes it a practical space for rapid iteration and technical validation.
	</p>

	<p>
		The core purpose of Mico is experimentation at scale: integrating APIs, testing AI behaviors,
		exploring automation flows, and evaluating system design patterns directly inside Discord.
	</p>

	<p>
		Each module inside Mico acts like a prototype unit. Some become stable features, others remain
		experimental, and some are discarded entirely. This lifecycle is intentional and central to its design.
	</p>

	<p>
		Mico reflects an engineering mindset: build fast, test in production-like environments,
		and continuously refine based on real usage rather than assumptions.
	</p>

	<p>
		In essence, Mico is not just a bot. It is an operational sandbox for OORTSKY’s system design,
		product experimentation, and AI-driven feature development.
	</p>
</Layout>
